  "id": "jargon",
  "term": "jargon",
  "definition": "In this historical usage, jargon means speech that has become confused and unintelligible, often through hurried, broken, or disordered utterance with omissions and repetitions. It refers to a severe loss of clear expression rather than merely specialized language.",
